title: AI Engineering Toolkit
abstract: 'Installable engineering infrastructure shared across the portfolio: a data provenance library,
  an LLM evaluation and calibration harness, a quantitative productivity toolkit and a data-fetch harness.
  Where an evaluation suite saturates, the documentation says so and reports the saturation rather than
  the perfect score.'
